From fa95eec5a288a0c38c66f497b6fd67519565b5e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naster17 <naster17.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:31:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(rocdbgapi): register native gfx1013 with RDNA1 debug
 semantics

Cyan Skillfish uses the gfx10.1 trap handler and register layout already selected by ROCr. Register ELF machine 0x042 and the native target triple, including its 32-bit XNACK mask. Keep gfx10.1 end-program behavior instead of enabling gfx10.3 capabilities.

Validation: repository pre-commit checks pass. Native library build, architecture queries and guarded device debug qualification follow on the BC-250 host.
---
 projects/rocdbgapi/include/amd-dbgapi.h.in |   1 +
 projects/rocdbgapi/src/architecture.cpp    | 285 +++++++++++----------
 projects/rocdbgapi/src/os_driver.h         |   1 +
 3 files changed, 153 insertions(+), 134 deletions(-)

diff --git a/projects/rocdbgapi/include/amd-dbgapi.h.in b/projects/rocdbgapi/include/amd-dbgapi.h.in
