  * - gfx1010 (Navi10)
  * - gfx1011 (Navi12)
  * - gfx1012 (Navi14)
+ * - gfx1013 (Cyan Skillfish)
  * - gfx1030 (Sienna Cichlid)
  * - gfx1031 (Navy Flounder)
  * - gfx1032 (Dimgrey Cavefish)
